<description>&lt;p&gt;Grenade blasts hit the southern insurgency zone, wounding security volunteers in Narathiwar and Yala and injuring army officers with a pipe bomb in the same area. Cambodia continues to protest Thailand's road construction in Oddar Meanchey and disputes over three border temples, while Thai officials reject the claims and urge calm. Thailand is introducing digital border passes to shorten queues at the Mae Sai crossing and has joined Singapore and Malaysia in the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZ2ZkaGhDWjg1YWh4S3NoVm9yclBVSTdoT1RTdGt3bU5jcnA2cW9YbDZDQWlKbEhfQnJvLV94NDNjVUFSWmtYY05UX1JfbXlWTGhWdGpDRFpCWk1NTFgzU1RPOEg3YzA3ejVfVVJ1Ymt5TnlRX21acV8zT1A3TG5PQ1ZabzVkdDlhbnNKTUMxWktMSjFLdHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPazNNVUo4TGMwVUNvT2VWUTZ6dkc1aEFwcFV1S0hEaFlBWG9zYkdoZzRHSXZXdmNxUXJ5cFh0aHRGT2dlTEktWDUyQUlXci1odklvX1pELVdaUS04TkY5YzU4UWFoTEZzRm5zUnZmbDVFMnVFNTllNndSYzNCdXprQzNkTnJnR3NnYU44QmcxQ3JobjRiZkxvd2oyWkJuREg0a2JLNzVfUEU0OE02WTlQRHp0UzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;CryptoRank&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPaWQyeGtGeldPUzQxd1JsY1pxRmRDeEZ4UzhNWG5iUE1aQ0hhZi1wTnVVV0RhaG9maWVxbmE1bzlDdTBUN21jUHdRekFBS1U0ZWlyQnlOVmdrNkJPUEMyaDlUZkVMX3hsVVRsdll1WHU2Q1dMdVl6cmo2YWh3MUVldGZqbVRfUFdyeGxGeGtUY0RtUTJ4Vjd5X1FhS2VFQllFTDExeUxXc3UwbnozVnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQaDVhRzN3S1ZWMG5HVndJLUR3eDUySzFvQU9yUUdsdlBDNWJITjhTZnRZYVRKY0NtWHNmZl80a3RtbnJnUXNtelVZZkNKcklpOUJIMFJ3YjdseEFWX1E5bXFmNkQ0RDcyVG1lUmxxSmFpYkxKVThMNm1wMDhSRjg1ZG9oeEZPV2xZZ0FFbA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times